5. image-4.5.26.tar.gz

  REQUIRED. The stub/static libraries and the shared images. To
  install it, as root do

  cd /tmp
  rm -rf ./lib
  gzip -dc image-4.5.26.tar.gz | tar xSvvof -
  cp -av ./lib ./usr /
  ldconfig -v

6. extra-4.5.26.tar.gz
 
