I have posted a new package from the Andrew User Interface System.
This one is aimed specifically at the programmer.  It provides "views"
of the source language you are using (C, C++, Pascal, Modula etc)
which are aware of the language syntax and assist in coding.

Beware that this package, auis62L2-src.tgz, requires the word
processing package, auis62L2-wp.tgz, as prerequisite.  These
must be at the same level - "L2" in this case.

